   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "<div style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #1a1a1a; max-width: 900px; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #e1e4e8; border-radius: 12px; background: #ffffff;\">\n",
    "  <!-- TOP DIAGRAM SECTION -->\n",
    "  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 24px; overflow-x: auto; padding: 10px 0;\">\n",
    "    <!-- STAGE 1: 2D Dataframe -->\n",
    "    <div style=\"text-align: center; flex-shrink: 0;\">\n",
    "      <div style=\"width: 110px; height: 120px; border: 2px dashed #9aa5b1; border-radius: 8px; background: #f8fafc; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; padding: 8px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0 auto;\">\n",
    "        <span style=\"font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: #475569;\">P features →</span>\n",
    "        <div style=\"border-top: 1px solid #cbd5e1; border-bottom: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 6px 0; font-size: 10px; color: #64748b;\">\n",
    "          Farm 1<br>Farm 2<br>⋮<br>Farm N\n",
    "        </div>\n",
    "        <span style=\"font-size: 10px; color: #64748b; font-weight: 600;\">N × P Matrix</span>\n",
    "      </div>\n",
    "      <div style=\"font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: #334155; margin-top: 8px;\">1. Farm Features</div>\n",
    "      </div>\n",
    "    <!-- Arrow 1 -->\n",
    "    <div style=\"text-align: center; color: #64748b; flex-shrink: 0;\">\n",
    "      <div style=\"font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: #2563eb; margin-bottom: 2px;\">Multi-Model<br>Evaluation</div>\n",
    "      <span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">➔</span>\n",
    "    </div>\n",
    "    <!-- STAGE 2: 3D Tensor (Stacked Folds/Models) -->\n",
    "    <div style=\"text-align: center; flex-shrink: 0;\">\n",
    "      <div style=\"position: relative; width: 130px; height: 120px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n",
    "        <!-- Stack Layer 3 (Fold K / Model M) -->\n",
    "        <div style=\"position: absolute; top: 0px; left: 16px; width: 100px; height: 90px; border: 1.5px solid #93c5fd; border-radius: 6px; background: #eff6ff; box-sizing: border-box;\"></div>\n",
    "        <!-- Stack Layer 2 -->\n",
    "        <div style=\"position: absolute; top: 8px; left: 8px; width: 100px; height: 90px; border: 1.5px solid #60a5fa; border-radius: 6px; background: #dbeafe; box-sizing: border-box;\"></div>\n",
    "        <!-- Stack Layer 1 (Front) -->\n",
    "        <div style=\"position: absolute; top: 16px; left: 0px; width: 100px; height: 90px; border: 2px solid #2563eb; border-radius: 6px; background: #bfdbfe; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; align-items: center; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: #1e3a8a;\">\n",
    "          N × K × M\n",
    "          <span style=\"font-size: 9px; font-weight: 500; color: #1e40af;\">Tensor</span>\n",
    "        </div>\n",
    "      </div>\n",
    "      <div style=\"font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: #334155; margin-top: 8px;\">2. Evaluation Tensor: Predictions &amp Error</div>\n",
    "    </div>\n",
    "    <!-- Arrow 2 -->\n",
    "    <div style=\"text-align: center; color: #64748b; flex-shrink: 0;\">\n",
    "      <div style=\"font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: #059669; margin-bottom: 2px;\">Precision<br>Weighting</div>\n",
    "      <span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">➔</span>\n",
    "    </div>\n",
    "    <!-- STAGE 3: 1D Series Prediction -->\n",
    "    <div style=\"text-align: center; flex-shrink: 0;\">\n",
    "      <div style=\"width: 70px; height: 120px; border: 2px solid #10b981; border-radius: 8px; background: #ecfdf5; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; align-items: center; padding: 6px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0 auto; color: #065f46;\">\n",
    "        <span style=\"font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 4px;\">🎯</span>\n",
    "        <span style=\"font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700;\">N × 1</span>\n",
    "        <span style=\"font-size: 9px; text-align: center;\">Ŷ Yields</span>\n",
    "      </div>\n",
    "      <div style=\"font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: #334155; margin-top: 8px;\">3. Predicted Yields</div>\n",
    "    </div>\n",
    "  </div>\n",
    "  <hr style=\"border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; margin: 20px 0;\">\n",
    "  <!-- BOTTOM TEXT SECTION -->\n",
    "  <div style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #334155;\">\n",
    "    <p style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0;\">\n",
    "      <strong style=\"color: #0f172a;\">The tensor computes adaptive, farm-specific weights by penalizing:</strong> \n",
    "    </p>\n",
    "    <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px;\">\n",
    "      <div style=\"flex: 1; background: #f8fafc; border-left: 3px solid #ef4444; padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0;\">\n",
    "        <strong>🎯 Instability:</strong> High variance across cross-validation folds for that specific farm.\n",
    "      </div>\n",
    "      <div style=\"flex: 1; background: #f8fafc; border-left: 3px solid #f59e0b; padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0;\">\n",
    "        <strong>📉 Poor Fit:</strong> Weak overall baseline accuracy for that farm type.\n",
    "      </div>\n",
    "    </div>\n",
    "    <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13.5px; color: #475569; background: #f0fdf4; border: 1px solid #bbf7d0; padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 6px;\">\n",
    "      <b>Result:</b> A flexible, semi-model-agnostic predictor that adapts to localized signals rather than assuming a single model dominates globally.\n",
    "    </p>\n",
    "  </div>\n",
    "</div>"
   ]
  },
