   "source": [
    "<div style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #1e293b; max-width: 900px; background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); margin-bottom: 16px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\n",
    "\n",
    "  <!-- Card 1: Stability Ratio & Mechanics -->\n",
    "  <div style=\"border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\">\n",
    "    <h4 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; color: #0f172a; font-size: 0.98em; font-weight: 700;\">\n",
    "      Stability Ratio Diagnostic (&phi;<sub>i</sub>)\n",
    "    </h4>\n",
    "    <p style=\"margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 0.86em; color: #475569; line-height: 1.5;\">\n",
    "      Validates that ensemble aggregation captures competing model signals rather than smoothing over sampling noise:\n",
    "    </p>\n",
    "    <div style=\"background-color: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 6px; padding: 8px 12px; font-family: monospace; font-size: 0.82em; color: #0f172a; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\n",
    "      &phi;<sub>i</sub> = &sigma;̄<sub>i</sub><sup>m</sup> / &sigma;̄<sub>i</sub><sup>k</sup> &gt; 1\n",
    "    </div>\n",
    "    <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 0.84em; color: #475569; line-height: 1.5;\">\n",
    "      <strong>Takeaway:</strong> Over <strong>98% of farms satisfy &phi;<sub>i</sub> &gt; 1</strong>, confirming model diversity dominates fold-level variance and establishing a robust upper-bound prediction fit.\n",
