    "        <span></span> Empirical Diagnostics\n",
    "      </div>\n",
    "      <ul style=\"margin: 0; padding-left: 18px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; color: #334155;\">\n",
    "        <li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\"><b>Sub-Regional Variance Exploitation:</b> Spatial aggregation obscures localized micro-shocks; evaluating individual cross-fold residual distributions exposes true farm-level noise structures.</li>\n",
    "        <li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\"><b>Identifying Instability Profiles:</b> Uncovers farms where candidate models exhibit extreme out-of-fold variance, signaling localized structural breakdowns in standard unweighted predictors.</li>\n",
    "      </ul>\n",
    "    </div>\n",
    "    <!-- COLUMN 2: THE STAGE-TWO RESOLUTION -->\n",
    "    <div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 280px; background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 8px; padding: 14px;\">\n",
    "      <div style=\"font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 8px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.4px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\">\n",
    "        <span></span> Stage-Two Optimization Motive\n",
    "      </div>\n",
    "      <ul style=\"margin: 0; padding-left: 18px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; color: #334155;\">\n",
    "        <li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\"><b>Precision-Proportional Penalization:</b> Rather than discarding volatile farms, Stage Two applies adaptive dispersion weighting inversely proportional to cross-fold variance ($\\sigma_{i,k}^2$).</li>\n",
    "        <li style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\"><b>Noise Attenuation:</b> Dynamically dampens destabilizing model components in high-variance regimes while amplifying high-fidelity local signals.</li>\n",
    "      </ul>\n",
    "    </div>\n",
    "  </div>\n",
    "  <!-- HIGHLIGHT BANNER: THE EMPIRICAL TRIUMPH -->\n",
    "  <div style=\"background: #ecfdf5; border: 1px solid #a7f3d0; padding: 12px 16px; border-radius: 8px; color: #065f46; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.5;\">\n",
    "    <strong style=\"color: #047857; font-size: 14px; display: block; margin-bottom: 2px;\">The Empirical Payoff: Structural Accuracy Gain</strong>\n",
    "    By explicitly dampening model influence across high-dispersion farm units, the precision-weighted framework resolves conditional heteroskedasticity—yielding an immediate <b>~10% relative jump in out-of-sample explanatory power ($R^2$)</b> over standard unweighted ensembling.\n",
    "  </div>\n",
    "</div>"
