    "    <span style=\"background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #334155; font-size: 0.8em; font-weight: 600; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 20px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; font-family: monospace;\">\n",
    "      XGBoost Regressor + TreeExplainer\n",
