    "\n",
    "  <!-- Methodological Architecture -->\n",
    "  <div style=\"background-color: #f8fafc; border-left: 4px solid #2563eb; padding: 16px 20px; border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0;\">\n",
    "    <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 0.95em; color: #334155; line-height: 1.6;\">\n",
    "      <b>Methodological Architecture:</b> Supervised multi-input regression utilizing an <b>XGBoost objective with Pseudo-Huber loss</b> to handle heavy-tailed yield variance. Post-hoc explainability is derived via <b>exact TreeExplainer Shapley value estimation</b>. Features are filtered dynamically at the <b>79th percentile threshold of global mean absolute SHAP values</b> ($\\mathbb{E}[|S_i|]$) and mapped dual-axially to evaluate both global impact ranking (mean $|S_i|$) and localized density distributions via violin geometries.\n",
